# Exercise identity / PRs

Canonical helpers: `packages/shared/exerciseIdentity.ts`. Product rules: `docs/product.md`, pitfalls in `docs/pitfalls.md`.

- Alias only documented twins (run/jog, walk/walking, treadmill ↔ treadmill run).
- Do **not** merge run↔walk or barbell/Smith/machine.
- `trackedExercises` filters **PRs only** — never Strength/Cardio lists.
- PRs are all-time; do not tie PR math to the chart period.
- Prefer logged-first My exercises UX; no amber orphan banners on Analytics.
